# Just Keep Talking

This folder is the git repo. The parent directory is a local archive of original client files. Do not publish or edit those originals.

- Facts: `project/BRIEF.md`. Prices and portraits: `intake/2027-program-update/owner-confirmed-pricing-and-portraits.md`.
- Voice: `project/VOICE.md`. Owner copy sample: `intake/2027-program-update/website-information.txt`.
- Do not invent prices, billing labels, testimonials, credentials, policies, or contact details.
- Do not LLM-polish owner wording. No em dashes, “not X but Y,” or clever From/to headlines in site copy.
- One site under `app/`. Do not add a second static implementation.
- Use pnpm. Run `pnpm check` before handoff. Update `project/STATUS.md`.
- Live site: https://www.justkeeptalkingcr.com
- A push to `main` deploys GitHub Pages. Do not push unless the owner asks.
- The Cloudflare worker and `.openai/hosting.json` are unused starter files.

Example: a classes link may include `audience`, `format`, `currency`, and `size`. A home, story, policy, or recruitment link should not.
